  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 17772506644480
    m_Localized: Stopped wristwatch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976128
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-1031 - 2081-03-14

      Wristwatch found on Sublevel B. It stopped at 03:12 and the battery still works.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976129
    m_Localized: Thermos with a scratched-out name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976130
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-1047 - 2081-03-14

      Thermos of cold coffee, from a Sublevel A technician. The owner scratched his own name off the lid.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976131
    m_Localized: Reading glasses with one cracked lens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976132
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-1052 - 2081-03-14

      Reading glasses with one cracked lens, collected in boiler room 2. Nobody claimed them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976133
    m_Localized: Lunchbox with a child's note
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976134
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-1060 - 2081-03-14

      Lunchbox from a Workshop C technician. Inside there is a child''s note that says "come home soon".'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976135
    m_Localized: Plush rabbit with a hospital wristband
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976136
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-2004 - 2080-09-01

      Plush rabbit with a hospital wristband. It was admitted together with an underage subject.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976137
    m_Localized: Wallet with an ID card
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976138
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-2018 - 2080-12-11

      Wallet from an adult subject. The identity card is inside, but the photo can no longer be made out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976139
    m_Localized: Plastic rosary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976140
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-2023 - 2081-01-30

      Plastic rosary from an adult subject. The subject held it through every procedure.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976141
    m_Localized: Drawing of a house with a sun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976142
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-2031 - 2081-02-17

      Drawing of a house with a sun, made by an underage subject. The subject was not discharged.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976143
    m_Localized: Bloodied earplugs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976144
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-3002 - 2081-03-14

      Bloodstained earplugs, collected in the PA central. They were not enough.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976145
    m_Localized: Werkschutz badge, post 7
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976146
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-3009 - 2081-03-14

      Werkschutz badge, Post 7. Kessler was notified and nobody came to collect it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976147
    m_Localized: Cassette hand-labelled "AKT I"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976148
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-3015 - 2081-03-14

      Cassette with a handwritten AKT I label. It was inside the console of the PA central.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976149
    m_Localized: Melted studio headphones
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17772556976150
    m_Localized: 'VK-INV-3021 - 2081-03-14

      Found melted onto a maintenance employee. The owner had been listening to a recording without stopping.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
